sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant CO as Iovance (newswire)
  participant MS as Market service
  participant NW as NewsWatcher
  participant M as Model (Haiku)
  participant EV as events
  participant D as Dispatcher
  participant P as Phone
  participant B as Alpaca

  Note over CO: Wed 2026-10-28, after the 4pm ET close (exact time: check Alpaca news history)
  CO->>MS: press release appears in Alpaca news
  NW->>MS: GET /v1/news?symbols=held&after=cursor (every 60s)
  MS-->>NW: 1 new item: IOVA
  NW->>M: headline + full text + schema
  M-->>NW: TRIAL_READOUT, Thu 2026-10-29, pre-market, quote
  NW->>NW: check: quote is in the text, date parses
  NW->>EV: insert key catalyst:IOVA:2026-10-29
  D->>EV: NEW events since cursor
  D->>D: rule: readout under 24h, held, up over 30% in 3 months
  alt PAPER portfolio
    D->>B: SELL limit near price, extended hours
  else LIVE portfolio
    D->>P: push: IOVA readout tomorrow before the open. Sell 12 at about $16.40?
    P-->>D: Confirm
    D->>B: SELL limit near price, extended hours
  end
  B-->>D: fill (broker sync), activity log, push
